    narr:narration """The thread develops through [mandates requiring signed artifacts](narr:Narrative_SignedReleaseManifestEnforcement) across environments. Enforcement centers on [formal deployment requirements](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) spanning [staging and production targets](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), established in response to [past verification failures in staging](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) and reiterated as [baseline operational rules](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3).""" ;
